{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"把想被对方同样珍惜的愿望说得更具体，没有新增人物关系、外部事件或真实场景，也没有把珠子的比喻当成事实。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"保留了不把自己的喜欢当作对方回应义务的原则，也写出了压抑期待会让他觉得自己在自欺，没有添加无依据的情节或音乐因果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"反复犹豫、委屈疲惫和偶尔重新感到亲近本身很好，都是可以成立的心理状态，没有把珠子中的说话或仰望夜空写成真实行动。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S08-3已经写出想被对方同样珍惜的愿望开始浮现，S09-1顺势把这一愿望明确为希望对方主动靠近并把自己放在心上。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条依次写出他承认自己想被回应、又不愿把回应当成对方的义务，以及因此陷入犹豫和疲惫，单看线就能读懂这一段的心理冲突。\"\n  ,\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R41\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"原文明确写出他继续盼望时又怕爱变成对对方的要求，这一层担忧没有被完整保留；修补后只说对方不欠他回应，没有写出他害怕自己的持续期待会变成施压。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3acfc1a5-acb2-4c5b-8f40-50961d1157e5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T101722000447Z", "elapsed_seconds": 305.437, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T10:22:27.455253+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9e7a8dd5f585c14be3cc697e137bcdb1f37c429feb3065e61dbbb9c0bffb052c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb636